<h2>Verify Your Email</h2>
<p>Welcome to Famick Home Management!</p>
<p>You're creating a new household called <strong>{{HouseholdName}}</strong>.</p>
<p>Click the button below to verify your email and complete your registration:</p>
<a href="{{VerificationLink}}" class="button" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;background-color:#518751;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;margin:20px 0;font-size:15px;">Verify Email</a>
<p>This link will expire in 24 hours.</p>
<p><strong>If the button doesn't open the app</strong>, copy this verification token and paste it in the app:</p>
<div class="token-box" style="background-color:#f5f5f5;padding:15px;border-radius:4px;font-family:monospace;word-break:break-all;margin:15px 0;">{{Token}}</div>
<p>If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
